<h1>Character rejected</h1>

<p>
  Hi <%= @user.name %> — the character <strong><%= @character.name %></strong>
  for your project <strong><%= @project.name %></strong> was rejected.
</p>

<% if @feedback.present? %>
  <p>Your feedback:</p>
  <blockquote><%= @feedback %></blockquote>
<% end %>

<p>
  You can regenerate a new character for the same project — no video can be
  generated until a character is approved. Open the project here:
</p>
<p><a href="<%= @project_url %>"><%= @project_url %></a></p>
